#~| "turn-based strategy game with a fantasy theme and role-playing elements. "
#~| "The game is available for Microsoft Windows, Mac OS X, and various GNU/"
#~| "Linux distributions."
#~ msgid ""
#~ "<i>December 2014</i>. As the year comes to an end, a new stable release "
#~ "series begins. The development team is proud to present version 1.12 of "
#~ "<cite>The Battle for Wesnoth</cite>, a <a href='http://www.gnu.org/"
#~ "philosophy/philosophy.html'>free</a> and <a href='http://www.opensource."
#~ "org/'>open source</a> turn-based tactical strategy game with a high "
#~ "fantasy theme and role-playing elements. The game is available for "
#~ "Microsoft Windows, Apple OS X, and various GNU/Linux distributions."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<em>2012년 1월</em>. 여러분이 기다려왔던 새로운 안정 버전이 출시되어 전율"
#~ "을 다시 한번 만끽할 순간이 찾아왔습니다. 우리 <em>The Battle for Wesnoth</"
#~ "em> 팀은 판타지적 배경에 롤플레잉 요소를 포함한 턴방식 전략 게임이자 <a "
#~ "href='http://www.gnu.org/philosophy/philosophy.html'>자유로이 이용할 수 있"
#~ "는</a> <a href='http://www.opensource.org/'>오픈 소스</a> 게임인<em>The "
